{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52382","headline":"回波乐 二十五 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 二十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壮年凡几日？死去入士庵。\n论情即今汉，各各悉痴㤌（项校作「憨」）。\n唯缘二升米，是处即生食。\n礼佛遥言之，彼角仍图摊。\n贪钱险不避，逐法易成难。\n即今不如此，宁随体上寒。\n乍可无余仗（项谓应作「伏」，爲「服」之音误），愿得一身安。\n无爲日日悟，解脱朝朝喰（陈校作「餐」）。\n死去天堂（堂）上，遣你斫额看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}